cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Fayde in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Fayde: an astrometric plate solver"
abstract: >-
  Fayde solves the World Coordinate System of an astronomical image from a list of detected
  sources and whatever is known about the frame (pointing, scale, roll, epoch), against the
  UCAC4 catalogue, and returns a verified TAN or TAN-SIP solution with its measured accuracy.
authors:
  - family-names: Ryall
    given-names: Shane
version: 0.3.3
date-released: 2026-11-21
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24379728
repository-code: "https://github.com/shaneryall/Fayde"
keywords:
  - astrometry
  - plate solving
  - World Coordinate System
  - UCAC4
